{"annotationDigest":"sha256:fc939bc49efc44dd0b929a442f899c762bbc72f2c7c2e7839765bb7e949967a3","annotationId":"rann-1d6d97ad422c7a5f64c131a9658cb7e4","author":{"agent":"claude-code","kind":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5.5"},"createdAt":"2026-10-02T02:16:53Z","disclaimer":"AI-generated review opinion derived from the evidence package. It is not a verdict, does not change readiness, and must be confirmed by a human reviewer.","disclosureCheck":{"blocking":3,"contradictions":[],"disclosures":6,"nextDecision":"human_judgement","readiness":"not_assessed"},"findings":[{"claim":{"params":{"requirement":"SW-REQ-260922-B757"},"type":"requirement_affected"},"detail":"Only the signatures change (Menu.qml:199, :219): the unused _count/_filter/_divider parameters are dropped. The bodies are unchanged, and so are the fold, peek and 70% heights that B757 states. Both `// Implements: SW-REQ-260922-B757` lines stay above their functions. B757's cell is observed_pass: error_handling is inherited from SYS-REQ-260922-J0AN, and 2 tests passed (menu-compositor-test.sh, which now runs in the menu-live suite).","refs":[{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/Menu.qml","kind":"file","line":199},{"id":"shell/plugins/menu/Menu.qml","kind":"file","line":219},{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-B757","kind":"requirement"},{"id":"test/shell.d/menu-compositor-test.sh","kind":"test"}],"severity":"info","title":"The changed functions rowListHeight / dmenuRowListHeight trace to SW-REQ-260922-B757 (function level)","verification":{"evidence":[{"id":"SW-REQ-260922-B757","kind":"requirement"}],"method":"review.changes (spec, code-trace, function and call-level requirement impact)","note":"SW-REQ-260922-B757 is in review.changes (code_changed, matchLevel function).","status":"confirmed"}},{"detail":"These requirements share Menu.qml with the change, but none of their own text changed. The mirror's trace re-review (d493e6f5) re-stamped each of them with evidence. Their obligation cells in claimEvidence are observed_pass or not_linked. N